// Usage of EC2 Serial Console to Push an SSH Public Key (T1021.004 / T1021.008)
//
// Covers BOTH the key push and the account-level enable that must precede it.
// The enable is the more important of the two: it is an account-wide security
// downgrade affecting every instance, and it is the earliest point at which
// this technique becomes visible.
//
// NO NETWORK CORROBORATION EXISTS. The serial console is out-of-band — it
// bypasses security groups and NACLs, and the session does not appear in VPC
// Flow Logs. Unlike EC2 Instance Connect, there is no inbound-22 correlation to
// confirm the access. The control plane is the only record.
//
// Dialect: Sentinel / Azure Log Analytics KQL. NOT CloudWatch Logs Insights.
AWSCloudTrail
| where TimeGenerated > ago(7d)
| where (EventSource == "ec2-instance-connect.amazonaws.com"
         and EventName == "SendSerialConsoleSSHPublicKey")
     or (EventSource == "ec2.amazonaws.com"
         and EventName in ("EnableSerialConsoleAccess", "DisableSerialConsoleAccess"))
| extend Req = parse_json(RequestParameters)
| extend InstanceId = tostring(Req.instanceId)
| extend Succeeded  = isempty(ErrorCode)
| project TimeGenerated, EventName, UserIdentityArn, InstanceId,
          SourceIpAddress, UserAgent, AWSRegion, ErrorCode, Succeeded
| extend Verdict = case(
    EventName == "EnableSerialConsoleAccess" and Succeeded,
        "ACCOUNT SERIAL CONSOLE ENABLED — account-wide downgrade, P0",
    EventName == "SendSerialConsoleSSHPublicKey" and Succeeded,
        "SERIAL CONSOLE KEY PUSHED — out-of-band foothold, P0",
    ErrorCode == "SerialConsoleAccessDisabled",
        "BLOCKED BY ACCOUNT GATE — attempt made; investigate the principal",
    "SERIAL CONSOLE ACTIVITY — review")
| order by TimeGenerated desc
//
// A `SerialConsoleAccessDisabled` error means the account gate stopped the
// attempt. That is a successful control, not a non-event — the principal still
// tried, and should be investigated.
//
// The 7-day window is deliberate: EnableSerialConsoleAccess may precede the key
// push by a long interval, and it is easy to miss with a 24h lookback.
